{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51111","headline":"潮浪 · 崔致远","name":"潮浪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骤雪翻霜千万重，往来弦望蹑前踪。\n见君终更能怀信，惭我趋时尽放慵。\n石壁战声飞霹雳，云峰倒影撼芙蓉。\n因思宗慤长风语，壮气横生忆卧龙。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}